    "text": "By virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 6AB of the Exchange Control Act read with Section 44 of the saidAct, I, Ravi Karunanayake, Minister of Finance, do by this Order exempt persons resident in Sri Lanka from the applicationof the requirements under Section 6AB of the Exchange Control Act in respect of :",
